# integrations-reconcile
owner: integrations-maintainer · cadence: daily · status: SUGGESTED
**I see you want integrations as a clean structured property across all pages — want a loop that re-checks every wiki page for prose-only integrations and reconciles them into front matter on a schedule?**

## Prompt
Re-scan every wiki page for integrations present in body prose but missing from the front-matter `integrations:` property, reconcile, and log changes.

## Evidence
> Can life links be in the front matter? If so, then we should just make the integrations a property in that.
